// European perch (Perca fluviatilis): schooling predator of small fish in lakes and rivers.
// Mass ≈ 0.3 kg (up to 2 kg), ≈ 12 yr, maturity 2–3 yr (AnAge, order of magnitude).
// Fish feel the air temperature of their cell (at least 4 °C in water) as a proxy for water
// temperature. `litter` counts recruits that survive the larval stage, not eggs.
// Model: manifest `fish_perch`.
